# Shadows of the Departed (jeuno 88): the reply kinds. Ru'Lude Gardens' trigger area 1 has no NPC script, so a reply's
# kind shows only against another container's: ToAU mission Easterly Winds (current by a GM; its container comes before
# this quest's) plays progressEvent 10094 there whatever its state; two progressEvents with two csids take turns, where
# an event would always lose to it. A full bag (fill-inventory) keeps Easterly Winds current (its 10094 finish with
# option 1 completes it only when the Bronze Pieces are given). A level 75 Warrior, Storms of Fate completed, Zilart
# Awakening current, brought to status 3, Easterly Winds current: area 1: 10094, then 161 (begun); the three slivers (a
# GM): 10094, then 162 (completed). The crystals' keyItem actions have no rival on their NPCs (no script, no other
# container): their kind is not observable.
lists RuludeGardens/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/161 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/162
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=4,2.5,100 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.StormsOfFate completed
mission Zilart Awakening current
mission Toau EasterlyWinds current
login
warp 120.9,-8,-12 Norg                  # 176: status 1
warp 39.6,-1.6,-16.6 LowerJeuno         # by _6tc
trigger _6tc                            # 20
finish                                  # status 3
fill-inventory                          # a GM: Easterly Winds kept on its finish
warp 4,2.5,100 RuludeGardens
tick 3000                               # the zone-in lock (2.5 s) keeps trigger areas off
walk 4,2.5,60                           # 10094 and 161 tie: the first, 10094
finish option=1                         # kept
walk 4,2.5,100
walk 4,2.5,60                           # the turn: 161
finish                                  # begun
walk 4,2.5,100
keyitem PromyvionHollaSliver            # a GM: the three slivers
keyitem PromyvionDemSliver
keyitem PromyvionMeaSliver
walk 4,2.5,60                           # 10094 and 162 tie: 10094 (161's action is not in the list)
finish option=1                         # kept
walk 4,2.5,100
walk 4,2.5,60                           # the turn: 162
finish                                  # completed
